{"hw":"μαθητός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μαθητός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μαθητ-ός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">learnt, that may be learnt</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ἀνθρώποις</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">by</b> men, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.6.23</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἢ ἀσκητὸν ἢ μ. [ἡ ἀρετή</span>] <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Men.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">70a</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EN</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1099b9</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. τε καὶ διδακτά</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">319c</span> </span>.</div></div>"}